# Credentials for cf_ai_bench.py (Cloudflare Workers AI). Full reference:
# ../ENVIRONMENT.md and README.md in this folder.
#
# Preferred: a chmod-600 file outside the repo with these two lines (the
# script reads it itself and refuses a file that isn't 600):
#
#   Account ID: <32 hex characters, Cloudflare dashboard -> Workers AI>
#   API: <API token made from the "Workers AI" token template>
#
# Default location: ~/Desktop/sandbox/creds/cloudflare/AI/api.txt
CLOUDFLARE_AI_CREDS_FILE=$HOME/Desktop/sandbox/creds/cloudflare/AI/api.txt
#
# Or pass both values in the environment instead (e.g. in CI, from a secret
# store). Both must be set; then the file isn't read. Never commit them.
#CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
#CLOUDFLARE_AI_TOKEN=
